Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.92,0:00:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.94,0:00:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These words lured men to\Nthe Grand Line in pursuit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.32,0:00:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of dreams greater than\Nthey'd ever dared to imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.84,0:00:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the time known\Nas the Great Pirate Era.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.60,0:00:35.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come aboard and bring along\Nall your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:40.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything\Nthat we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.52,0:00:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Compass left behind,\Nit'll only slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.66,0:00:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your heart will be your guide,\Nraise the sails and take the helm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That legendary place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.22,0:01:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That the end of the map reveals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is only legendary.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.74,0:01:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until someone proves it real.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.20,0:01:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:14.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through all the trouble and times.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.58,0:01:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through the heartache\Nand through the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.90,0:01:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know that I will be there to stand by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like I know you'll stand by me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So come aboard and bring along.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All your hopes and dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.42,0:01:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Together we will find everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.96,0:01:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That we're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.16,0:01:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's always room for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want to be my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are, we are on a cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.36,0:01:49.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.44,0:01:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, which one of you is Arlong?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.94,0:02:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that just happens to be my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can call me Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.42,0:02:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, what are you\Nsupposed to be? A pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.48,0:02:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.06,0:02:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.54,0:02:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to talk to the boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you got to talk to us first, get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.36,0:02:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.84,0:02:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what does a pirate want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.06,0:02:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.48,0:03:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's making our navigator cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.14,0:03:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off, you're out of your league.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you just had to\Nrun on ahead by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.94,0:03:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I can handle\Nthese bozos on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.68,0:03:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, you fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.36,0:03:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never said anything about being worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just don't want you\Nhogging all the action. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.32,0:03:36.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I just want to let you guys know\Nthat I don't mind if you hog at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you're raring to go, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.66,0:03:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the unknown swordsman\NI was telling you about!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Roa Noah Zoro. I thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.10,0:03:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That bastard tricked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.82,0:03:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:50.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.08,0:03:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Sian and Yanker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.68,0:03:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, hook, lion, and sinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, look, long nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.30,0:03:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.12,0:04:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We saw Nami kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.26,0:04:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Nami was a traitor all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as I suspected.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.92,0:04:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.60,0:04:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.72,0:04:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That guy just decked Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.04,0:04:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.98,0:04:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No human should be able to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.58,0:04:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't we tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.44,0:04:36.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just stay back here Now do you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.56,0:04:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,why we're keeping you\Naway from that fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.64,0:04:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys will just get\Nin their way But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.12,0:04:46.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I don't understand What\Nreason could they possibly have to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.40,0:04:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Nami was crying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.54,0:04:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they need any more reason than\Nthat to put their lives on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A pirate, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.60,0:05:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all starting to make sense now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been after Nami\Nthis whole time. But.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl is mine and\NI'm not giving her up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.98,0:05:23.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunch of idiots like you\Naren't worth Arlong's time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know how to deal with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, it's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.50,0:05:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on here, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama, rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.08,0:05:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the beast from the Grand Line\Nthat destroyed the town of Gosa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.16,0:06:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's actually real! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:16.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.52,0:06:23.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems he's a friend of the fishmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.56,0:06:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.78,0:06:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.46,0:06:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't just leave! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:38.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leaving?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, isn't that a shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.92,0:06:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, I suppose if you really want to\Nrun away, Then who am I to stop you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.04,0:07:03.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's coming right before us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.40,0:07:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.90,0:07:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.80,0:07:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all mine, you dumb cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.36,0:07:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's got a\Nplan for once. We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His arms are drenched!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.56,0:07:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So he must have devil\Nfruit powers. Powers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:00.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.54,0:08:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.33,0:08:06.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's he doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.30,0:08:08.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if I want to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.70,0:08:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for something new!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.58,0:08:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.60,0:08:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,IT WILL!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright, that's it, Arlong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.94,0:08:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done playing games with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.42,0:08:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here to beat\Ndown all your cronies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.78,0:08:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I came here to teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.86,0:08:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.18,0:08:42.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I will. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.38,0:08:48.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I was just thinking about\Nhow painfully I'll end your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.74,0:08:50.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the worst plan ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.14,0:08:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you're trying\Nto kill all of us, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.74,0:09:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:05.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just can't believe there's a human\Nwho can throw that giant monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:08.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if the gods\Nthemselves are fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.38,0:09:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you hurt our brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.68,0:09:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, it seems that we\Nmust now join in the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.08,0:09:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you'll get an education in\Nthe inferiority of your species!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.66,0:09:26.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh really, I'd like to see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.98,0:09:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let us handle this!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you go on one of your\Nrampages to squash these insects,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.18,0:09:39.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you destroy all of Arlong Park. Choo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.30,0:09:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, just let us kill these weaklings!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:47.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, they're yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.60,0:09:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, guys, there's something\NI should tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.66,0:09:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's that octopus doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.48,0:10:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Octopus is best when\Nit's cut thin and salted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.40,0:10:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Add some olive oil and paprika and it\Nmakes the perfect snack while drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So listen to me, guys,\NI'm kind of in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.46,0:10:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zero vision!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.24,0:10:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hachi Black!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.70,0:10:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.61,0:10:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come you didn't dodge that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.38,0:10:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see Squat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to finish you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.38,0:10:30.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get out of there, Loopy, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.38,0:10:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't run.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.14,0:10:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.78,0:10:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My feet are kind of stuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're the one who stuck them\Ninto the ground in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.16,0:10:47.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always thinking ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.38,0:10:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One Hachi inkjet served on the rocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:11.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're such a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji, that was so\Ntotally awesomely awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:19.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I ended up picking one\Nhell of an idiot to be my captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's great! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.94,0:11:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the truth is that our idiot captain is
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:29.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,far better than a gang\Nwho'd prey on a lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.92,0:11:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lady, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.73,0:11:36.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rushed into certain\Ndeath for one lousy girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.82,0:11:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lousy girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you insult Nami one more time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:44.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can promise that you'll go\Nfrom fish man to fish sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.12,0:11:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.34,0:11:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your skills are quite\Nexceptional for a human,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.52,0:11:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I must admit that chivalry from\Na pirate seems just a little fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.78,0:11:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm damn good at what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I guarantee you there's nothing fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:12:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About my desire to help\Na beautiful lady in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'll be acquainting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.60,0:12:09.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the true superiority\Nof the fishman's species.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.82,0:12:15.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work, but they're still stuck. Still?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're still stuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We could pull all day And I bet my\Nlegs would still be stuck in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.08,0:12:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you trying at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.60,0:12:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or do you want to stay stuck here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.64,0:12:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe no one told you that the penalty for\Nplaying around in Arlong Park was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.06,0:12:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get unstuck already, get unstuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Luffy, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.38,0:12:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.16,0:12:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a little bit busy at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.16,0:12:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take me on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.52,0:12:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oooh, you're Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.34,0:12:52.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:54.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get away with tricking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:13:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And how dare you mercilessly\Nslaughter so many of my brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.82,0:13:05.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That stuff's old news, Octopus Man.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.18,0:13:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I personally don't care what reasons\Nyou have for wanting to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.36,0:13:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The situation has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, the tables have turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.96,0:13:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not the hunters\Nanymore, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.38,0:13:19.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's you fish freaks\Nwho are being hunted
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.14,0:13:22.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell him Zoro that octopus guy is yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.44,0:13:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're dead. I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:44.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must actually want me to kill you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.42,0:13:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.58,0:13:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that the guy who\Nsaved Genzo's life earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.60,0:13:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.62,0:13:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the people from Cocoyashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.86,0:14:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging from the fact\Nthat you all have weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only assume that\Nthis is a rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.50,0:14:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll all have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exploding Star!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.78,0:14:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get through Usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.60,0:14:13.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you think it would be easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.82,0:14:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dealing with me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.64,0:14:18.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.55,0:14:20.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get rid of you right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:25.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is that lad?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.98,0:14:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brave one minute and cowardly the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.44,0:14:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a baffling man.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.38,0:14:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get back here, Long Nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:36.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're one to talk, Big Mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.64,0:14:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are these people pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You morons are a pathetic sight to behold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.12,0:14:48.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of watching this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.84,0:14:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But sir, there's no\Nreason to go on a rampage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of our long park.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:55.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.98,0:14:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just thought of a fun game that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:15:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're going down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly think your sad\Nlittle group can defeat us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:11.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what if we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.12,0:15:14.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so what if we do, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.62,0:15:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.94,0:15:17.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got something to say to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know that those with\NDevil Fruit powers can't swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.08,0:15:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But honestly, anybody in this situation\Nwould sink right to the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Pistol! The sea! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.54,0:15:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.74,0:15:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oww!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.44,0:15:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.42,0:15:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:01.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.68,0:16:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.98,0:16:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait don't be stupid those fishmen can't\Nwait for us to jump in the water after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.92,0:16:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd have an obvious advantage\Nin an underwater fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.66,0:16:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to\Nsave Luffy! We've got to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:30.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take these guys out at\Nthe same time then go in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water. There's no time.\NCome on, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.88,0:16:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah so how long can he\Nhold out time? Is ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.32,0:16:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh so that's the game
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.74,0:16:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it you can take
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.08,0:16:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the fish you slice and trim the octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.82,0:17:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.38,0:17:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm almost out of breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.84,0:17:07.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.90,0:17:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't help himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:10.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.24,0:17:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Luffy's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.30,0:17:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can't even breathe underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.92,0:17:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Humans are such pitiful\Ncreatures, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, calamari, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.30,0:17:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Game, game!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.86,0:17:39.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass in five seconds flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.90,0:17:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have more than three.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.70,0:17:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.76,0:17:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're both running headlong into death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.42,0:17:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of you will leave this place alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:02.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.10,0:18:04.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna be killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.30,0:18:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat his ass real quick\Nand then come save you, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A-chi-ing-cha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.18,0:18:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, you bastard! My hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.78,0:18:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.22,0:18:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.34,0:18:28.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll grow back. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.22,0:18:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Zoro, you can't beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.66,0:18:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have six hands that will mesmerize\Nyou with their wiggly beauty. Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.74,0:18:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Triple! Sword! Catch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.70,0:18:43.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, you will see my skills!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.42,0:18:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.88,0:18:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.94,0:18:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:55.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is he still hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.94,0:18:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lose focus and you lose your luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:19:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you taste good! Butter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.62,0:19:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got no time left! No time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.16,0:19:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.94,0:19:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hunchy suckers are stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.84,0:19:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just stick there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.44,0:19:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get down here and fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.66,0:19:21.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn coward.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.12,0:19:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stupid octopus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:26.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just trying to waste our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.32,0:19:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if we try to save Luffy now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they'll just drag us to the\Nbottom of the sea and we'll drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we sit here and do nothing,\Nthen Luffy drowns for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.12,0:19:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to think of a way to help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.20,0:19:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What good are the two of you going to do\Nin the sea when you both can barely walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.58,0:19:45.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're trying to figure out\Na way to save that young man,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.56,0:19:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then I believe I should be the\None to volunteer ahead of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll save him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.62,0:19:53.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo, I'm coming with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it! I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.14,0:19:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:58.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fishmen will suspect that we're up to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:20:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,something if we go with\Nsuch a large crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.70,0:20:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I fear doing so may\Ncause more harm than good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we could help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.84,0:20:05.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now another word about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.90,0:20:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point endangering\Nmore people than we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.64,0:20:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.56,0:20:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.36,0:20:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.26,0:20:16.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.18,0:20:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Genzo, I'm going too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.22,0:20:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Gecko, you're hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.02,0:20:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not going to\Nleave me out of this when
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.92,0:20:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,those guys are fighting\Nfor my sister's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.48,0:20:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.52,0:20:32.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we have to hurry. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.78,0:20:35.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.22,0:20:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only I was stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please save Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.76,0:20:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.28,0:20:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I have a question that I've\Nbeen meaning to ask you, Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're famous for your three-sword\Ntechnique, so why are you only using one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.16,0:20:55.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're running scared with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would I need three?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:20:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've just been playing around with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.50,0:21:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, humans can't defeat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.82,0:21:04.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can tell you why, but I think\Nit'd be more fun to show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.58,0:21:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, show. I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you're really going\Nto enjoy it a lot, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.16,0:21:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.07,0:21:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't fight back the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.18,0:21:22.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, I thought as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.40,0:21:27.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still haven't recovered\Nfrom your fight with Hawkeye?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.16,0:21:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you may tremble in fear\Nat Hachi's way of six blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.06,0:21:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're not supposed to die yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.28,0:21:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't even killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.48,0:21:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Zoro! I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.68,0:21:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's been faking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.92,0:21:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So true.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.30,0:21:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way he's been pummeled would kill any\Nnormal guy, but he tries to fight anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.02,0:21:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'd you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.26,0:21:57.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.82,0:22:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He walked around just like nothing had\Nhappened after such a horrible fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.34,0:22:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's laid out flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.86,0:22:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you to pay attention\Nto me, you weakling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.06,0:22:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a 40th Don in Fishman Karate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.60,0:22:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.56,0:22:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.42,0:22:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.33,0:22:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.60,0:22:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.14,0:22:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're taking care of, Arlong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.46,0:22:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would you like us to do with Zoro?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.64,0:22:35.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.22,0:22:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just toss him in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.02,0:22:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hardly entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.50,0:22:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aww, that's all?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.94,0:22:47.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, they did manage\Nto make a bit of a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.38,0:22:48.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.56,0:22:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as Arlong Park\Nis still standing. True.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.04,0:22:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.34,0:22:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed himself!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.66,0:23:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never got the chance to show\Nhim how great of a swordsman I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.14,0:23:04.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he could have died on one of my six\Nblades, I could have stolen his fame!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.94,0:23:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.48,0:23:09.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There isn't a human alive that can\Ncompare to my way of six blades!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.58,0:23:14.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the superior power that only a\Nsix-armed Master Swordsman can attain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.80,0:23:23.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough, Hachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.28,0:23:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand how you must feel, but if\Nyou continue this little demonstration?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.72,0:23:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll destroy Arlong Park. Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot I could destroy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.60,0:23:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.82,0:23:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.22,0:23:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way of six blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.20,0:23:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.66,0:23:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.04,0:23:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.34,0:23:58.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me make this clear for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.38,0:24:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a sorry excuse for a swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.38,0:24:02.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a certain man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.86,0:24:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to face and then till I see him
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death himself cannot touch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.04,0:24:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.00,0:24:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.16,0:24:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, big bro!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.82,0:24:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the best punch that fishman's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.68,0:24:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The old man's kicks were a\Nhundred times worse than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.34,0:24:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I never even died.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.96,0:24:45.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop following me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.44,0:25:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm alone, but always now\NI'm done, I'll keep you near.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.10,0:25:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I drift away, I pray you'll\Nwatch me as I disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.58,0:25:19.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I watch the sunrise, I begin to wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.76,0:25:24.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could be the reason\Nit's so hot inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.44,0:25:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No answer has come, but I can't\Nget away from what's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.56,0:25:33.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.94,0:25:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show me how to catch those feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.64,0:25:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get them to come back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.74,0:25:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do what I must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.04,0:25:45.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they're everything I want to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.80,0:25:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wrap these arms around my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.32,0:25:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And pull them back from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm holding hands with you,\NI'm sure that we can make the way.

